<title>UK: ROYAL BANK OF SCOTLAND UP ON MIDSHIRES DEAL.</title>
<headline>ROYAL BANK OF SCOTLAND UP ON MIDSHIRES DEAL.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Royal Bank of Scotland Group Plc rose on Wednesday after the group announced the terms of its acquisition of the Birmingham Midshires building society.</p>
<p>The shares rose 4p to 629-1/2p by 0825 GMT, against a generally declining stock market.</p>
</text>
